</jpcrp030000-asr_E00571-000:NotesRegardingGainOnTransferOfBusinessTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E00571-000:NotesRegardingGainOnForgivenessOfDebtsFromSubsidiariesAndAffiliatesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">
